# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-06-19 01:12

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:12
translate ptbr carlthursday_c65b0f17:

    # m "\"Are you sure you don't wanna come down?\""
    m "\"Cê tem certeza que não quer descer?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:13
translate ptbr carlthursday_a19484c5:

    # "Carl lays spread out on his bed, game controller clutched in both of the paws that are thrown over his head against the pillow."
    "O Carl tá deitado esparramado na cama dele, controle do videogame apertado nas duas patas que tão jogadas pra cima da cabeça contra o travesseiro."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:14
translate ptbr carlthursday_8ef0af74:

    # "He offers me a glance, but returns back to his game."
    "Ele me dá uma olhada, mas volta pro jogo dele."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:15
translate ptbr carlthursday_789f8e77:

    # "This time it's a new-looking open-world fantasy and, honestly, I'd much rather be watching him play it than doing homework."
    "Dessa vez é uma fantasia de mundo aberto que parece nova e, honestamente, eu preferia muito mais estar assistindo ele jogar do que fazendo lição de casa."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:16
translate ptbr carlthursday_494fcee1:

    # c "\"I just don't wanna distract ya, man, and you know how much help I am.\""
    c "\"Eu só não quero te distrair, cara, e cê sabe o quanto eu ajudo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:17
translate ptbr carlthursday_e499761a:

    # "I frown."
    "Eu franzo a testa."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:18
translate ptbr carlthursday_b5de73aa:

    # m "\"Well, it'd be more for the company than anything. Don't you wanna look through the stuff, too?\""
    m "\"Bom, seria mais pela companhia do que qualquer outra coisa. Cê não quer dar uma olhada nas coisas também?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:19
translate ptbr carlthursday_b1190473:

    # "Carl screws up his muzzle, as if contemplating."
    "O Carl torce o focinho, como se tivesse contemplando."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:20
translate ptbr carlthursday_b6f7a9f5:

    # c "\"I've seen most of it, dude. I wrapped up half the stuff in there.\""
    c "\"Eu já vi a maior parte, cara. Eu que embrulhei metade das coisas lá.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:21
translate ptbr carlthursday_e8255891:

    # m "\"Well, alright...\""
    m "\"Bom, beleza...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:22
translate ptbr carlthursday_7800f7e9:

    # "I pause, but he doesn't say anything."
    "Eu dou uma pausa, mas ele não fala nada."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:23
translate ptbr carlthursday_c52ac982:

    # "It's clear he's not interested, so I have no reason to nag him."
    "Tava claro que ele não tava interessado, então não tinha motivo pra ficar enchendo o saco dele."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:24
translate ptbr carlthursday_f939e134:

    # "Still, it sort of hurts my feelings..."
    "Ainda assim, de certa forma fere meus sentimentos..."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:27
translate ptbr carlthursday_bc55bb9a:

    # "As I make my way into the basement alone, I realize another reason why I would have appreciated Carl's company."
    "Enquanto eu desço pro porão sozinho, percebo outro motivo pelo qual eu teria apreciado a companhia do Carl."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:28
translate ptbr carlthursday_cdd0bc91:

    # "The house IS as creepy as fuck."
    "A casa É assustadora pra caralho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:29
translate ptbr carlthursday_cb6d4d28:

    # "I've always been a bit of a pussy when it comes to scary things."
    "Sempre fui meio medroso quando se trata de coisas assustadoras."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:30
translate ptbr carlthursday_51d01781:

    # "I mean, once, after I'd seen a scary movie about possession, I'd been afraid to go to sleep for weeks, mainly because my nightmares can seem so real."
    "Quer dizer, uma vez, depois de ter visto um filme de terror sobre possessão, eu fiquei com medo de dormir por semanas, principalmente porque meus pesadelos podem parecer muito reais."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:31
translate ptbr carlthursday_dd5095e9:

    # "It took almost a month for me to manage it without the lights on and I was eighteen at the time."
    "Levou quase um mês pra eu conseguir dormir sem as luzes acesas e eu tinha dezoito anos na época."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:32
translate ptbr carlthursday_ea9947f7:

    # "And now I mentally kick myself for remembering that movie while I'm down in Carl's creepy basement, alone."
    "E agora eu me xingo mentalmente por lembrar daquele filme enquanto tô aqui embaixo no porão assustador do Carl, sozinho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:34
translate ptbr carlthursday_fbb23ad6:

    # "Once I get to the crawlspace I do an awkward, half-run to the flood lamp that probably would have made Carl laugh his ass off."
    "Quando chego no porãozinho, dou uma meia corrida desajeitada até o holofote que provavelmente teria feito o Carl rir pra caralho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:39
translate ptbr carlthursday_27db3857:

    # "The crawlspace really is fucking creepy."
    "O porãozinho é realmente assustador pra caralho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:40
translate ptbr carlthursday_5da2013a:

    # "I imagine Carl sleep walking down here (which I'm pretty sure is what happened last night) then waking up alone in the dark."
    "Eu imagino o Carl sendo sonâmbulo e descendo até aqui (que eu tenho quase certeza que foi o que aconteceu ontem à noite) e depois acordando sozinho no escuro."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:41
translate ptbr carlthursday_0d290a7a:

    # "I can understand why he was so freaked out."
    "Eu consigo entender por que ele tava tão assustado."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:42
translate ptbr carlthursday_315a497a:

    # "The sight of the plastic tarp at the bottom of the steps brings back memories of the tarantula as well."
    "A visão da lona de plástico na parte de baixo da escada traz de volta lembranças da tarântula também."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:43
translate ptbr carlthursday_298513db:

    # m "\"Shit...\""
    m "\"Merda...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:44
translate ptbr carlthursday_b3cdb3a2:

    # "Now I have good reason not to go down there at all."
    "Agora eu tenho um bom motivo pra não descer lá de jeito nenhum."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:45
translate ptbr carlthursday_e712e4f3:

    # "I still don't know if what I saw was real, or was some kind hypnagogic hallucination that my mind always seems so keen to throw at me."
    "Eu ainda não sei se o que eu vi era real, ou se era algum tipo de alucinação hipnagógica que minha mente sempre parece tão ansiosa pra jogar em mim."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:46
translate ptbr carlthursday_17b5d8f5:

    # "I scan the tarp, it's white and clean surface free of any insects, as far as I can tell."
    "Eu examino a lona, é uma superfície branca e limpa, livre de qualquer inseto, pelo que eu posso ver."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:47
translate ptbr carlthursday_62492a0f:

    # "I shudder again before making my way slowly down the steps, eyes still darting around."
    "Eu estremeço de novo antes de descer as escadas lentamente, os olhos ainda correndo pros lados."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:48
translate ptbr carlthursday_71bdef76:

    # m "\"Come on you idiot, this is ridiculous...\""
    m "\"Qual é, seu idiota, isso é ridículo...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:49
translate ptbr carlthursday_29a27c08:

    # "When I was younger I used to have a problem where I'd wake up in the middle of the night and see spiders crawling up my walls."
    "Quando eu era mais novo, eu costumava ter um problema onde eu acordava no meio da noite e via aranhas subindo pelas minhas paredes."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:50
translate ptbr carlthursday_6c7c88f2:

    # "I'd scream and one of my parents would come running in to tell me nothing was there."
    "Eu gritava e um dos meus pais vinha correndo pra me dizer que não tinha nada lá."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:51
translate ptbr carlthursday_202de2a4:

    # "My dad talked to his psychologist friend who told him it was normal, so we didn't do anything about it."
    "Meu pai falou com o amigo psicólogo dele, que disse que era normal, então a gente não fez nada a respeito."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:52
translate ptbr carlthursday_bf4b01e8:

    # "Over time, the hallucinations stopped."
    "Com o tempo, as alucinações pararam."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:53
translate ptbr carlthursday_d94a912b:

    # "They didn't come back until I took the night shift near my university's campus."
    "Elas não voltaram até eu pegar o turno da noite perto do campus da minha universidade."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:54
translate ptbr carlthursday_a0dce93a:

    # "After that, I started to get sleep paralysis and, about half the time, spiders are involved."
    "Depois disso, eu comecei a ter paralisia do sono e, cerca de metade das vezes, envolvia aranhas."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:55
translate ptbr carlthursday_d5135837:

    # "My feet crunch their way across the tarp, back toward the tubs that I know are marked \"History\"."
    "Meus pés fazem barulho ao atravessar a lona, de volta em direção aos potes que eu sei que tão marcados como \"História\"."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:56
translate ptbr carlthursday_b7271981:

    # "I stare at them for a second, remembering that two days ago the tubs had been turned to have their sides facing the entrance to the crawlspace."
    "Eu olho pra eles por um segundo, lembrando que dois dias atrás os potes tinham sido virados pra que os lados ficassem de frente pra entrada do porãozinho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:57
translate ptbr carlthursday_f95d4523:

    # "I clearly remember seeing them that way over Carl's shoulder, right before I saw the tarantula."
    "Eu lembro claramente de tê-los visto daquele jeito por cima do ombro do Carl, logo antes de ver a tarântula."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:58
translate ptbr carlthursday_8f78ad08:

    # "Now they're turned so that their ends are pointing to the front."
    "Agora eles tão virados pra que as pontas deles fiquem apontando pra frente."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:59
translate ptbr carlthursday_a2260bee:

    # "I frown, but the prickling feeling on my neck doesn't feel good, especially with me being alone down here..."
    "Eu franzo a testa, mas a sensação de formigamento no meu pescoço não é boa, especialmente estando sozinho aqui embaixo..."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:60
translate ptbr carlthursday_53305657:

    # "So I shove that to the back of my mind and grab the end of the bottom tub so I can start dragging it back toward the stairs."
    "Então eu empurro isso pro fundo da mente e agarro a ponta do pote de baixo pra poder começar a arrastar de volta pras escadas."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:61
translate ptbr carlthursday_657a7540:

    # "Sitting down and taking the lids off, I start sifting through the contents."
    "Sentando e tirando as tampas, eu começo a vasculhar o conteúdo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:62
translate ptbr carlthursday_3853062c:

    # "Again, something isn't right."
    "Mais uma vez, algo não tá certo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:63
translate ptbr carlthursday_9c39f2f4:

    # "There are a few empty wrappers lying around among the artifacts, as if someone had unwrapped a few trinkets before taking them."
    "Tem algumas embalagens vazias espalhadas entre os artefatos, como se alguém tivesse desembrulhado algumas bugigangas antes de pegá-las."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:64
translate ptbr carlthursday_c7dbfca6:

    # "I wonder if Carl decided to take a few things? God knows why he would."
    "Será que o Carl decidiu pegar algumas coisas? Sabe Deus por que ele faria isso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:65
translate ptbr carlthursday_47371b9e:

    # "I remove those wrappers, three in all, and set them to the side before digging further in."
    "Eu tiro essas embalagens, três no total, e as coloco de lado antes de cavar mais fundo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:66
translate ptbr carlthursday_c4d45884:

    # "This particular tub has a divider in it."
    "Esse pote em particular tem uma divisória dentro."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:67
translate ptbr carlthursday_7831877b:

    # "As I start unwrapping things, I realize that one side is for the harder artifacts, like keys, or knitting needles."
    "Enquanto começo a desembrulhar as coisas, percebo que um lado é para os artefatos mais duros, como chaves ou agulhas de tricô."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:68
translate ptbr carlthursday_5b01b283:

    # "The other has mostly paper items, like photos, and documents."
    "O outro tem principalmente itens de papel, como fotos e documentos."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:69
translate ptbr carlthursday_1cfa6bfb:

    # "On the paper side, I see a thick folder labeled \"Biography of James Hendricks\"."
    "No lado do papel, vejo uma pasta grossa com o rótulo \"Biografia de James Hendricks\"."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:70
translate ptbr carlthursday_cca89d89:

    # "My eyes widen."
    "Meus olhos se arregalam."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:71
translate ptbr carlthursday_a6c5a4de:

    # "Now THAT would come in handy."
    "Agora, ISSO seria muito útil."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:72
translate ptbr carlthursday_46a45a47:

    # "Is this a book, or..."
    "Isso é um livro, ou..."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:73
translate ptbr carlthursday_0265bc90:

    # "As I open it up I find a bunch of loose papers inside. While it's clearly copy paper, it's old enough in its own right."
    "Ao abrir, encontro um monte de papéis soltos dentro. Embora seja claramente papel de cópia, é antigo por si só."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:74
translate ptbr carlthursday_6ca11450:

    # "I move back down to the tarp so I can start spreading the documents out, not wanting to lose anything."
    "Volto pra lona pra poder começar a espalhar os documentos, sem querer perder nada."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:75
translate ptbr carlthursday_2fdd12a6:

    # "I'm breathing heavily at this point, hardly believing my luck."
    "Eu tô respirando pesado nesse ponto, mal acreditando na minha sorte."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:76
translate ptbr carlthursday_c261136b:

    # "There are hundreds of pages and I hardly know where to start."
    "Tem centenas de páginas e mal sei por onde começar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:77
translate ptbr carlthursday_99813d6b:

    # "After a while I begin to deduce what this is."
    "Depois de um tempo, começo a deduzir o que é isso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:78
translate ptbr carlthursday_ff256922:

    # "Someone's been trying to write a book on James Hendricks. From what I can tell it was Carl's mother, Trisha."
    "Alguém estava tentando escrever um livro sobre James Hendricks. Pelo que posso dizer, foi a mãe do Carl, Trisha."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:79
translate ptbr carlthursday_11d876b2:

    # "Some of the documents were typed out on a typewriter, so this might have been started as far back as the 80s."
    "Alguns dos documentos foram datilografados numa máquina de escrever, então isso pode ter começado lá nos anos 80."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:80
translate ptbr carlthursday_769a2f8b:

    # "Getting married, having kids, and running a company probably slowed things down just a little bit."
    "Casar, ter filhos e administrar uma empresa provavelmente atrasou as coisas um pouquinho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:81
translate ptbr carlthursday_b91092c0:

    # "I grin."
    "Eu dou um sorriso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:82
translate ptbr carlthursday_5f84c8ce:

    # "While it's too bad that this might never see publication, Carl's mom has no idea how much she's saved my ass."
    "Embora seja uma pena que isso talvez nunca seja publicado, a mãe do Carl não faz ideia do quanto ela salvou a minha pele."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:83
translate ptbr carlthursday_5aead7cc:

    # "On top of that, she's got it all organized."
    "Além de tudo, ela tem tudo organizado."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:84
translate ptbr carlthursday_1e5507b6:

    # "One divider indicates \"James Hendricks\" while another marks \"Emma Hendricks\" who I assume is James' wife."
    "Uma divisória indica \"James Hendricks\" enquanto outra marca \"Emma Hendricks\", que presumo ser a esposa do James."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:85
translate ptbr carlthursday_2a8ebd24:

    # "A few of them are filled with several names; \"Marilyn Smith/John Begay/Yanaha Begay/Christopher Leeway\"."
    "Algumas delas tão preenchidas com vários nomes; \"Marilyn Smith/John Begay/Yanaha Begay/Christopher Leeway\"."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:86
translate ptbr carlthursday_c650f72a:

    # "Finally, the last section of the binder is filled with dividers indicating dates \"1825-1852\", \"1852-1875\", \"1875-1878\", and \"1878-1891\"."
    "Finalmente, a última seção do fichário tá preenchida com divisórias indicando datas: \"1825-1852\", \"1852-1875\", \"1875-1878\" e \"1878-1891\"."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:88
translate ptbr carlthursday_4a8aff36:

    # "I start with that, my fingers shaking a bit with excitement as I start pouring over Trisha's meticulous time line, using my phone to take notes."
    "Eu começo com isso, meus dedos tremendo um pouco de emoção enquanto eu começo a examinar a linha do tempo meticulosa da Trisha, usando meu celular pra fazer anotações."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:90
translate ptbr carlthursday_72d40dd1:

    # "James was born in 1825 to an immigrant family from Eire."
    "James nasceu em 1825 numa família de imigrantes de Eire."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:91
translate ptbr carlthursday_ccc90a22:

    # "His family faced oppressive prejudice from the day they arrived in the country."
    "A família dele enfrentou um preconceito opressivo desde o dia em que chegaram no país."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:92
translate ptbr carlthursday_739a1d52:

    # "Despite this, they managed to make a living with James' father becoming a plumber, a profession that mainly dealt with lead."
    "Apesar disso, eles conseguiram ganhar a vida com o pai do James se tornando um encanador, uma profissão que lidava principalmente com chumbo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:93
translate ptbr carlthursday_60cf6c11:

    # "His father, Martin, was abusive, even more so than was acceptable for the time and James suffered greatly for it."
    "O pai dele, Martin, era abusivo, até mais do que era aceitável pra época, e o James sofreu muito com isso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:94
translate ptbr carlthursday_c9503de6:

    # "The mysterious death of his five year old sister, Martha, lead many of the townspeople to suspect murder on the father's part—"
    "A morte misteriosa de sua irmã de cinco anos, Martha, levou muitos habitantes da cidade a suspeitarem de assassinato por parte do pai—"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:95
translate ptbr carlthursday_6bab5802:

    # "—but this was never proven."
    "—mas isso nunca foi provado."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:96
translate ptbr carlthursday_c7007819:

    # "James left home at the age of fifteen."
    "James saiu de casa aos quinze anos."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:97
translate ptbr carlthursday_e76662e5:

    # "He told his remaining sibling, Jane, that if he were able, he'd find a place for both of them to stay to escape their father."
    "Ele disse pra sua irmã restante, Jane, que se ele pudesse, encontraria um lugar pra ambos ficarem e escaparem do pai deles."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:98
translate ptbr carlthursday_be1b67da:

    # "Not much is known about James Hendricks between 1840 and 1849, with Trisha assuming that he simply job hopped around the Tri-State area."
    "Não se sabe muito sobre James Hendricks entre 1840 e 1849, com a Trisha presumindo que ele simplesmente pulou de emprego em emprego pela área dos Três Estados."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:99
translate ptbr carlthursday_cba0f247:

    # "What IS known is that James set out West in 1850 during the gold rush."
    "O que SE sabe é que James partiu pro Oeste em 1850 durante a corrida do ouro."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:100
translate ptbr carlthursday_6d916c74:

    # "Luck struck quick with James finding gold in a quartz deposit in 1852."
    "A sorte bateu rápido com James encontrando ouro num depósito de quartzo em 1852."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:101
translate ptbr carlthursday_bdc99137:

    # "The first person James confided in about the find was his only friend, John Begay."
    "A primeira pessoa em quem James confiou sobre a descoberta foi seu único amigo, John Begay."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:102
translate ptbr carlthursday_02e48ab5:

    # "John was a Native desert fox, and would go on to become James' business partner."
    "John era uma raposa-do-deserto nativa e se tornaria o parceiro de negócios do James."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:103
translate ptbr carlthursday_3cd449e8:

    # "This comes as a bit of a surprise due to John's many recorded instances of prejudice against the Natives."
    "Isso é uma surpresa devido aos muitos casos registrados de preconceito do John contra os nativos."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:104
translate ptbr carlthursday_7a47046f:

    # "With John's help, James officially laid claim to the mine before turning it into a business."
    "Com a ajuda do John, James reivindicou oficialmente a mina antes de transformá-la num negócio."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:105
translate ptbr carlthursday_18edf992:

    # "While Echo was originally a small camp of less than twenty people, it became a mini boomtown."
    "Enquanto a Echo era originalmente um pequeno acampamento de menos de vinte pessoas, ela se tornou uma mini cidade em expansão."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:106
translate ptbr carlthursday_de74a0ee:

    # "Over two thousand people arrived within the next three years."
    "Mais de duas mil pessoas chegaram nos três anos seguintes."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:107
translate ptbr carlthursday_d3c4b51a:

    # "Things went well for James after that."
    "As coisas correram bem pro James depois disso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:108
translate ptbr carlthursday_cef76ae8:

    # "He became rich, built a mansion in Echo, and lived off the mine's seemingly endless flow of gold."
    "Ele ficou rico, construiu uma mansão em Echo e viveu do fluxo aparentemente interminável de ouro da mina."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:109
translate ptbr carlthursday_e85b6c34:

    # "He sent Jane, who was married with a large family at that point, a yearly sum of money."
    "Ele mandava pra Jane, que a essa altura era casada e tinha uma família grande, uma quantia anual de dinheiro."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:110
translate ptbr carlthursday_536603a2:

    # "Meanwhile, no money was sent to his parents who were living in deep poverty."
    "Enquanto isso, nenhum dinheiro foi mandado pros pais dele, que viviam em extrema pobreza."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:111
translate ptbr carlthursday_56b9f9a7:

    # "He married Emma, a girl half his age, in 1860."
    "Ele se casou com Emma, uma garota com metade da sua idade, em 1860."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:112
translate ptbr carlthursday_09113428:

    # "They had five children; James, Thomas, Genevieve, Carol, and Martha."
    "Eles tiveram cinco filhos: James, Thomas, Genevieve, Carol e Martha."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:113
translate ptbr carlthursday_4bb68163:

    # "Things changed for James in 1875, though, when he was accused of sodomy with John Begay."
    "Mas as coisas mudaram pro James em 1875, quando ele foi acusado de sodomia com o John Begay."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:114
translate ptbr carlthursday_c612cb91:

    # "The land being lawless at the time, John Begay was hanged by the locals."
    "Como as terras eram sem lei na época, John Begay foi enforcado pelos habitantes locais."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:115
translate ptbr carlthursday_5d70ac21:

    # "James was never convicted of the crime, likely because of his strong influence in the town."
    "James nunca foi condenado pelo crime, provavelmente por causa da forte influência dele na cidade."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:116
translate ptbr carlthursday_5664d6bb:

    # "However, the ostracism grew to be too much and, in 1878, he left his family to live in solitude on the West Coast."
    "No entanto, o ostracismo cresceu demais e, em 1878, ele deixou sua família pra viver em solidão na Costa Oeste."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:117
translate ptbr carlthursday_2e4f82e3:

    # "He quietly started a moderately successful ice cream business in the 1880s."
    "Ele abriu silenciosamente um negócio de sorvetes moderadamente bem-sucedido na década de 1880."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:118
translate ptbr carlthursday_2337cc86:

    # "It didn't grow into the regional juggernaut it is today until it was taken over by his grandson, Peter."
    "O negócio não se tornou a potência regional que é hoje até ser assumido por seu neto, Peter."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:120
translate ptbr carlthursday_041f000c:

    # "He died there in his villa in 1891 from an unusual insect bite."
    "Ele morreu lá em sua vila em 1891 de uma picada de inseto incomum."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:121
translate ptbr carlthursday_59f7be89:

    # "I rub my eyes and check the time; three hours have passed already and it's late in the afternoon."
    "Eu esfrego os olhos e checo a hora; já se passaram três horas e é fim de tarde."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:122
translate ptbr carlthursday_671e19e7:

    # "Apparently Carl's game is so good he hasn't even bothered to come down and check on me."
    "Aparentemente o jogo do Carl tá tão bom que ele nem se deu ao trabalho de descer pra ver como eu tô."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:123
translate ptbr carlthursday_28257d29:

    # "I sigh and gather up a few of the items; a pocket watch, what looks like a nugget of gold, and what I think is a stamp with a crest on it."
    "Eu suspiro e junto alguns dos itens; um relógio de bolso, o que parece ser uma pepita de ouro e o que acho que é um carimbo com um brasão."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:124
translate ptbr carlthursday_b0faf66d:

    # "I'll need to take the pictures outside considering how dim it is down here."
    "Vou precisar tirar as fotos lá fora, considerando como tá escuro aqui embaixo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:128
translate ptbr carlthursday_a1441850:

    # "I lay the items down on the adobe sidewalk that leads up to Carl's house."
    "Eu coloco os itens na calçada de adobe que leva até a casa do Carl."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:129
translate ptbr carlthursday_53f46800:

    # "Deciding that will make a suitable background, I start taking pictures."
    "Decidindo que aquilo daria um fundo adequado, começo a tirar fotos."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:130
translate ptbr carlthursday_16580fee:

    # "Hours after the discovery of the binder I'm still relieved."
    "Horas após a descoberta do fichário, ainda tô aliviado."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:131
translate ptbr carlthursday_2ca8fe4c:

    # "I was really starting to worry with how little time I had left, but Trisha's research has saved me hours of time."
    "Eu já tava começando a me preocupar com o pouco tempo que me restava, mas a pesquisa da Trisha me poupou horas de trabalho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:132
translate ptbr carlthursday_f72746a7:

    # "In fact, she'd pretty much laid everything out for me."
    "Na verdade, ela praticamente preparou tudo pra mim."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:134
translate ptbr carlthursday_378f88e4:

    # "I nearly jump out of my skin and spin around, still clutching my camera."
    "Eu quase pulo fora da minha pele e me viro, ainda segurando minha câmera."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:135
translate ptbr carlthursday_bcbf224a:

    # "Behind me, I can see the window still rattling from the force of whatever had knocked on it."
    "Atrás de mim, vejo a janela ainda tremendo por causa da força do que quer que tenha batido nela."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:136
translate ptbr carlthursday_4817900b:

    # "It's a basement window, in a window well, though I can't see anything through it. It's too dark."
    "É uma janela de porão, num poço de janela, embora eu não consiga ver nada através dela. Tá escuro demais."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:137
translate ptbr carlthursday_792a1e05:

    # "I stare for a while, frowning."
    "Eu fico encarando por um tempo, franzindo a testa."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:138
translate ptbr carlthursday_99de24cc:

    # "What the fuck was Carl doing? Did he go back downstairs and somehow see me through the window and decide to scare me?"
    "Que porra que o Carl tava fazendo? Será que ele voltou pro andar de baixo e de alguma forma me viu pela janela e decidiu me assustar?"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:139
translate ptbr carlthursday_470cb82c:

    # "I slowly gather the artifacts back up and place them in my bag, keeping an eye on the window as I do."
    "Eu pego os artefatos devagarzinho e os coloco na minha bolsa, de olho na janela enquanto faço isso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:140
translate ptbr carlthursday_5f754bbc:

    # "If he wanted to pull that shit then I could play at that game, too."
    "Se ele queria fazer essa merda, então eu também podia jogar esse jogo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:143
translate ptbr carlthursday_e365b76d:

    # "The only problem is that Carl isn't in the basement."
    "O único problema é que o Carl não tá no porão."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:144
translate ptbr carlthursday_214c6b5e:

    # "From what I can gather it was the window next to the crawl space that was hit."
    "Pelo que eu posso entender, foi a janela perto do porãozinho que foi atingida."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:145
translate ptbr carlthursday_756f9e8c:

    # "Looking out, I can see the spot where I must have been standing."
    "Olhando pra fora, consigo ver o lugar onde eu devia estar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:146
translate ptbr carlthursday_a96a9084:

    # "The chills return and I shiver as I move back to the crawl space."
    "Os calafrios voltam e eu estremeço enquanto volto pro porãozinho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:149
translate ptbr carlthursday_e624a02d:

    # "It had to have been Carl, though I don't get why he wouldn't have stayed down here until I came back."
    "Tinha que ter sido o Carl, embora eu não entenda por que ele não teria ficado aqui embaixo até eu voltar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:150
translate ptbr carlthursday_3b68fb0d:

    # "I gather everything back up and start to place them back into the tub in the same order I had taken them out."
    "Eu junto tudo de novo e começo a colocá-los de volta no pote na mesma ordem em que os tirei."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:151
translate ptbr carlthursday_303ebc39:

    # "And that's when I notice something; at the very bottom of the tub a plastic baggy has been opened with its contents spilled out."
    "E é aí que eu noto uma coisa; bem no fundo do pote, um saquinho de plástico foi aberto com o seu conteúdo derramado."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:152
translate ptbr carlthursday_06f126f6:

    # "I set down the binder which I had been about to put away and reach in, sifting through the spilled papers."
    "Eu deixo o fichário que eu tava prestes a guardar e meto a mão, peneirando os papéis derramados."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:153
translate ptbr carlthursday_552a8f7f:

    # "They're newspaper clippings from the town of Payton."
    "São recortes de jornal da cidade de Payton."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:154
translate ptbr carlthursday_4c195813:

    # "They're incredibly old, and I can't imagine this is the best way to preserve them."
    "Eles são incrivelmente velhos, e não imagino que essa seja a melhor forma de preservá-los."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:155
translate ptbr carlthursday_7a80156f:

    # "Either way, the fashion in which they're carelessly spread out across the bottom of the tub makes me wince."
    "De qualquer forma, o jeito como tão espalhados de forma descuidada no fundo do pote me faz fazer careta."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:156
translate ptbr carlthursday_c59e5822:

    # "I don't remember leaving it this way and it makes me feel sick that I could have damaged any of it."
    "Eu não lembro de ter deixado desse jeito e me dá enjoo pensar que eu poderia ter danificado algum deles."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:157
translate ptbr carlthursday_31798caa:

    # "Slowly, I push all of the clippings back into the baggie, making sure to seal it tight after I do."
    "Lentamente, eu empurro todos os recortes de volta pro saquinho, certificando-me de selá-lo bem depois que eu faço isso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:158
translate ptbr carlthursday_b017dcbe:

    # "From what I can see, nothing's been visibly damaged."
    "Pelo que vejo, nada foi visivelmente danificado."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:159
translate ptbr carlthursday_9b807baf:

    # "I sigh before putting everything back in the tub and shutting it with the lid, making sure it's sealed tight."
    "Eu suspiro antes de colocar tudo de volta no pote e fechá-lo com a tampa, me certificando de que tá bem selado."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:160
translate ptbr carlthursday_5248ce4c:

    # "It's a shame that it's been so difficult for Carl's family to set up the museum."
    "É uma pena que tem sido tão difícil pra família do Carl montar o museu."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:161
translate ptbr carlthursday_89280882:

    # "From the looks of it some of this stuff isn't going to last much longer without proper preservation."
    "Pelo que parece, algumas dessas coisas não vão durar muito mais tempo sem a preservação adequada."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:162
translate ptbr carlthursday_560bcd11:

    # "Finally, I drag the tubs back and subconsciously take note of exactly how I left them before heading back upstairs."
    "Finalmente, eu arrasto os potes de volta e, inconscientemente, anoto exatamente como os deixei antes de voltar pro andar de cima."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:166
translate ptbr carlthursday_9685f18a:

    # "When I get upstairs, though, Carl is asleep."
    "Quando chego no andar de cima, porém, o Carl tá dormindo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:167
translate ptbr carlthursday_a5488ffe:

    # "His controller is still above his head, clutched in his paws, as if he'd fallen asleep the moment I'd left."
    "O controle dele ainda tá acima da cabeça, apertado nas patas, como se ele tivesse pegado no sono no momento em que eu saí."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:168
translate ptbr carlthursday_0cb0fa00:

    # "On the screen his character is immobile, standing in the middle of some hut."
    "Na tela, o personagem dele tá imóvel, parado no meio de alguma cabana."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:169
translate ptbr carlthursday_b4914427:

    # "A single NPC stands in front of him, walking back and forth."
    "Um único NPC tá de pé na frente dele, andando pra lá e pra cá."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:170
translate ptbr carlthursday_28f4ee0b:

    # "Every now and then it stops in front of him, exclaiming \"what are you doing in my hut!?\"."
    "De vez em quando ele para na frente dele, exclamando \"o que você tá fazendo na minha cabana!?\"."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:171
translate ptbr carlthursday_16a1cca5:

    # "I reach out and place a paw on his shoulder and he immediately opens his eyes, snorting loudly."
    "Eu estendo a mão e coloco uma pata no ombro dele e ele imediatamente abre os olhos, bufando alto."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:172
translate ptbr carlthursday_036c8b46:

    # "He sits up and rubs at his face, snorting again as he breaths deeply."
    "Ele se senta e esfrega o rosto, bufando de novo enquanto respira fundo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:173
translate ptbr carlthursday_f86e0fb0:

    # m "\"Did you go downstairs?\""
    m "\"Cê foi lá embaixo?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:175
translate ptbr carlthursday_9f026a11:

    # c "\"Huh? what happened?\""
    c "\"Hã? o que aconteceu?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:176
translate ptbr carlthursday_e2c702b1:

    # "It's almost funny how utterly confused he looks. If he's acting he's doing a damn good job of it."
    "É quase engraçado o quão confuso ele parece. Se ele tá atuando, ele tá fazendo um ótimo trabalho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:177
translate ptbr carlthursday_dcaaf19a:

    # m "\"I heard some noises downstairs. I thought it was you.\""
    m "\"Eu ouvi uns barulhos lá embaixo. Achei que era você.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:178
translate ptbr carlthursday_9a79e70a:

    # c "\"No...I don't think so.\""
    c "\"Não... eu acho que não.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:179
translate ptbr carlthursday_64ff2661:

    # m "\"Things were moved around, too.\""
    m "\"As coisas foram mexidas, também.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:180
translate ptbr carlthursday_4a3fa5ab:

    # "He takes in a deep breath before blowing it out."
    "Ele respira fundo antes de soltar o ar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:181
translate ptbr carlthursday_c0b520e5:

    # c "\"I told you, man, this place is haunted. I wasn't joking.\""
    c "\"Eu te falei, cara, esse lugar é assombrado. Eu não tava brincando.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:182
translate ptbr carlthursday_90955c4c:

    # "We both look at each other for a moment."
    "Nós dois nos olhamos por um momento."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:183
translate ptbr carlthursday_cd5d0362:

    # "Finally, Carl breaks the awkward silence."
    "Finalmente, o Carl quebra o silêncio constrangedor."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:185
translate ptbr carlthursday_f56d7d93:

    # c "\"So how'd it go, aside from the ghosts?\""
    c ""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:186
translate ptbr carlthursday_094974a3:

    # m "\"It went alright. Just three hours and a bunch of research.\""
    m "\"Foi tudo bem. Só três horas e um monte de pesquisa.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:187
translate ptbr carlthursday_fb02ab9d:

    # "He looks at me blearily."
    "Ele me olha de forma embaciada."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:188
translate ptbr carlthursday_0f8496b1:

    # c "\"Aww, shit, seriously? I was gonna come down after a while, I just...\""
    c "\"Ah, merda, sério? Eu ia descer depois de um tempo, eu só...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:189
translate ptbr carlthursday_c7eba1a0:

    # m "\"Fell asleep, yeah. Anyway, we were supposed to go out today.\""
    m "\"Pegou no sono, é. Enfim, a gente ia sair hoje.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:190
translate ptbr carlthursday_43f4a658:

    # c "\"Really?\""
    c "\"Sério?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:191
translate ptbr carlthursday_3d75dd8d:

    # m "\"Yeah, remember? You said so a few days ago.\""
    m "\"É, lembra? Cê disse isso há uns dias.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:192
translate ptbr carlthursday_fd499485:

    # "Carl looks around."
    "O Carl olha em volta."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:193
translate ptbr carlthursday_10783745:

    # c "\"Well, what'd you wanna do?\""
    c "\"Bom, o que cê quer fazer?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:194
translate ptbr carlthursday_a5ed7e8b:

    # "I think."
    "Eu penso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:195
translate ptbr carlthursday_e07eeffe:

    # m "\"Don't you have an interview tomorrow?\""
    m "\"Cê não tem uma entrevista amanhã?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:196
translate ptbr carlthursday_b4af30eb:

    # c "\"Don't remind me.\""
    c "\"Nem me lembre.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:197
translate ptbr carlthursday_f5f34220:

    # "Carl picks up his controller again and I frown."
    "O Carl pega o controle dele de novo e eu franzo a testa."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:198
translate ptbr carlthursday_2126758c:

    # m "\"Welll, I was thinking we could go out and maybe give you a new look?\""
    m "\"Bom, eu tava pensando em a gente sair e talvez te dar um visual novo?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:199
translate ptbr carlthursday_6fefd4c3:

    # "Now Carl frowns, clicking away at the controller."
    "Agora o Carl franze a testa, clicando no controle sem parar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:200
translate ptbr carlthursday_134fe1f9:

    # c "\"Like what?\""
    c "\"Tipo o quê?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:201
translate ptbr carlthursday_d6ab3445:

    # m "\"Well, your clothes, for one. Do you have any dress clothes?\""
    m "\"Bom, suas roupas, pra começar. Você tem alguma roupa social?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:202
translate ptbr carlthursday_36bf7954:

    # c "\"Uhhh...\""
    c "\"Uhhh...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:203
translate ptbr carlthursday_7a52faaa:

    # m "\"You don't, seriously? Have you ever had an interview before?\""
    m "\"Cê não tem, sério? Já fez alguma entrevista na vida?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:204
translate ptbr carlthursday_4061e592:

    # c "\"Well yeah, it's just that I've, uh, grown out of them.\""
    c "\"Bom, sim, é que, uh, elas não me servem mais.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:205
translate ptbr carlthursday_5348256b:

    # m "\"Uh-huh. Well, we'll definitely need you to get some of those.\""
    m "\"Aham. Bom, a gente definitivamente vai precisar arranjar algumas dessas pra você.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:206
translate ptbr carlthursday_69431b4f:

    # "I look at his beard thoughtfully."
    "Eu olho pra barba dele pensativamente."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:207
translate ptbr carlthursday_5b24d43b:

    # m "\"Maybe we should give you a more...clean cut look?\""
    m "\"Talvez a gente devesse te dar um visual mais... limpo?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:208
translate ptbr carlthursday_5419bc9f:

    # "Carl doesn't say anything and instead goes on frowning."
    "O Carl não diz nada e em vez disso continua franzindo a testa."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:209
translate ptbr carlthursday_815309e0:

    # "I put a paw down on his controller, forcing him to pause."
    "Eu coloco uma pata no controle dele, forçando ele a pausar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:210
translate ptbr carlthursday_406b2969:

    # m "\"Come on, it could be fun. You can't stay in this house - in this room - forever."
    m "\"Qual é, pode ser divertido. Cê não pode ficar nessa casa - nesse quarto - pra sempre.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:212
translate ptbr carlthursday_731c9341:

    # "He finally does look at a me, then, his expression kind of sad."
    "Ele finalmente olha pra mim, então, a expressão meio triste."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:213
translate ptbr carlthursday_3c6a4d52:

    # m "\"What's wrong?\""
    m "\"O que foi?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:214
translate ptbr carlthursday_4748615e:

    # "Carl looks away, then stands up slowly, his joints popping."
    "O Carl desvia o olhar, depois se levanta devagar, as juntas estalando."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:215
translate ptbr carlthursday_49e98e9a:

    # c "\"Nothing. If it makes you happy then why not?\""
    c "\"Nada. Se te faz feliz, então por que não?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:216
translate ptbr carlthursday_21fdf938:

    # m "\"Great!\""
    m "\"Ótimo!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:217
translate ptbr carlthursday_46216044:

    # c "\"Just so you know I'd rather just play some video games with you...\""
    c "\"Só pra constar, eu preferia só jogar videogame contigo...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:218
translate ptbr carlthursday_336cbd76:

    # "It's tempting; just watching Carl play is a lot of fun what with his style and commentary, but this is more important."
    "É tentador; só assistir o Carl jogando é muito divertido, com o estilo dele e os comentários, mas isso é mais importante."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:219
translate ptbr carlthursday_1a5cf506:

    # "I really want to help him out."
    "Eu realmente quero ajudar ele."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:221
translate ptbr carlthursday_9cb69f05:

    # m "\"Maybe later tonight. Let's get this done first!\""
    m "\"Talvez mais tarde. Vamos resolver isso primeiro!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:224
translate ptbr carlthursday_75f0f869:

    # m "\"So apparently your great-great-great-great grandfather was accused of sodomy.\""
    m "\"Então, aparentemente seu tataratataratataravô foi acusado de sodomia.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:225
translate ptbr carlthursday_ad11fa37:

    # c "\"What!?\""
    c "\"O quê!?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:226
translate ptbr carlthursday_009621d1:

    # "Carl looks up from his phone, his muzzle wrinkling."
    "O Carl desvia o olhar do celular, franzindo o focinho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:227
translate ptbr carlthursday_6be6ffc0:

    # m "\"Yep, with John Begay, who I'm almost positive is related to Jenna, but I'll have to ask her.\""
    m "\"Aham, com o John Begay, que eu tenho quase certeza de que é parente da Jenna, mas vou ter que perguntar a ela.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:228
translate ptbr carlthursday_8ac2e855:

    # c "\"Are you serious? How did you find that out?\""
    c "\"Sério? Como você descobriu isso?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:229
translate ptbr carlthursday_25e1e0a5:

    # "He pauses."
    "Ele faz uma pausa."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:230
translate ptbr carlthursday_405f69d6:

    # c "\"And maybe don't ask Jenna about that.\""
    c "\"E talvez não pergunte isso pra Jenna.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:231
translate ptbr carlthursday_4824843b:

    # m "\"From what I can tell your mom's trying to write a book.\""
    m "\"Pelo que eu entendi, sua mãe tá tentando escrever um livro.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:232
translate ptbr carlthursday_9ba4efe8:

    # "Carl strokes his beard."
    "O Carl alisa a barba."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:233
translate ptbr carlthursday_38552513:

    # c "\"Oh yeah, she is, isn't she?...well, WAS, more like. I don't think she's worked on it in years.\""
    c "\"Ah é, ela tá, não tá?... bom, ESTAVA, melhor dizendo. Eu acho que ela não mexe nisso há anos.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:234
translate ptbr carlthursday_2e53b503:

    # m "\"From the looks of it she started it in college.\""
    m "\"Pelo que parece, ela começou na faculdade.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:235
translate ptbr carlthursday_50dcdb43:

    # c "\"Damn.. well, I do remember her saying it stressed her out a lot, or that something happened to make her stop...\""
    c "\"Caramba... bom, eu lembro dela dizendo que isso estressava muito ela, ou que algo aconteceu pra fazer ela parar...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:236
translate ptbr carlthursday_97bd0817:

    # "Carl seems to be thinking."
    "O Carl parece estar pensando."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:237
translate ptbr carlthursday_0c763479:

    # c "\"Actually, I think I remember her talking to my dad about how those old things freaked her out, or something.\""
    c "\"Na verdade, eu acho que lembro dela falando pro meu pai sobre como aquelas coisas velhas assustavam ela, ou algo assim.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:238
translate ptbr carlthursday_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "Ele dá de ombros."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:239
translate ptbr carlthursday_8b6674be:

    # c "\"But we've always said the house is haunted."
    c "\"Mas a gente sempre disse que a casa é assombrada.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:240
translate ptbr carlthursday_6a5d7827:

    # "Carl's phone starts buzzing."
    "O celular do Carl começa a vibrar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:241
translate ptbr carlthursday_45163f88:

    # c "\"And speaking of Jenna...she's calling me.\""
    c "\"E falando na Jenna... ela tá me ligando.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:242
translate ptbr carlthursday_55a42394:

    # "Carl looks a bit perturbed, but he puts on a cheerful voice as he answers it."
    "O Carl parece um pouco perturbado, mas ele engrossa a voz pra uma mais alegre ao atender."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:243
translate ptbr carlthursday_84d7c3e8:

    # c "\"Yo, whale-ears!\""
    c "\"E aí, orelha-de-baleia!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:244
translate ptbr carlthursday_72cb0161:

    # "Ah, that old name."
    "Ah, aquele velho apelido."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:245
translate ptbr carlthursday_50491760:

    # "As he listens to her response I see his smile slowly slide off his face."
    "Enquanto ele escuta a resposta dela, eu vejo o sorriso dele lentamente sumir do rosto."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:246
translate ptbr carlthursday_b59e0970:

    # "I can hear the sharp, muffled tones of Jenna's voice, even though he's holding the phone on the other side of his face."
    "Eu consigo ouvir os tons agudos e abafados da voz da Jenna, mesmo ele segurando o celular do outro lado do rosto."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:247
translate ptbr carlthursday_0295e8bd:

    # c "\"I don't—\""
    c "\"Eu não—\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:248
translate ptbr carlthursday_e79ed8ea:

    # "I guess she cuts him off because he doesn't finish."
    "Acho que ela o corta porque ele não termina a frase."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:249
translate ptbr carlthursday_c4ccab7b:

    # "I glare."
    "Eu lanço um olhar feio."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:250
translate ptbr carlthursday_09641561:

    # m "\"Here, let me talk to her.\""
    m "\"Aqui, deixa eu falar com ela.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:251
translate ptbr carlthursday_37742dec:

    # "The way Jenna acted yesterday (which isn't like her at all) is giving me a pretty good idea of what she's going off about right now."
    "O jeito que a Jenna agiu ontem (o que não é nada a cara dela) tá me dando uma boa ideia do que ela tá surtando agora."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:252
translate ptbr carlthursday_84867d41:

    # "Carl doesn't give me the phone though, instead just staring out the windshield as we continue on the highway."
    "O Carl não me dá o celular, no entanto, em vez disso só fica olhando pelo para-brisa enquanto a gente continua na rodovia."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:253
translate ptbr carlthursday_f4bd548c:

    # "Finally, he lower the phone from his ear, then stares at the the screen for a while."
    "Finalmente, ele tira o celular da orelha, depois fica olhando pra tela por um tempo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:254
translate ptbr carlthursday_13330599:

    # m "\"She hang up?\""
    m "\"Ela desligou?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:255
translate ptbr carlthursday_5c474ab4:

    # c "\"Yeah...Said something about how Leo's depressed now, and how us hanging out by ourselves isn't helping things.\""
    c "\"É... Falou alguma coisa sobre como o Leo tá deprimido agora, e como a gente sair sozinho não tá ajudando as coisas.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:256
translate ptbr carlthursday_46b7b77a:

    # "I roll my eyes."
    "Eu reviro os olhos."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:257
translate ptbr carlthursday_a468cd16:

    # m "\"You know what? Fuck Jenna. She's been on one since Leo's day didn't go the way he wanted it to.\""
    m "\"Sabe de uma coisa? Foda-se a Jenna. Ela tá nessa desde que o dia do Leo não foi como ele queria.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:258
translate ptbr carlthursday_9a6b9f84:

    # m "\"For some reason she just wants to blame you.\""
    m "\"Por algum motivo, ela só quer culpar você.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:259
translate ptbr carlthursday_85118972:

    # c "\"Yeah...\""
    c "\"É...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:260
translate ptbr carlthursday_81f76e15:

    # "Carl looks out his window, so I can't really gage the mood he's in."
    "O Carl olha pela janela dele, então eu não consigo avaliar o humor que ele tá."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:261
translate ptbr carlthursday_09b34d29:

    # m "\"Listen, let's get something to eat first. I'll buy.\""
    m "\"Escuta, vamos comer alguma coisa primeiro. Eu pago.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:262
translate ptbr carlthursday_e92b1334:

    # c "\"No. My parents are rich. I'll pay.\""
    c "\"Não. Meus pais são ricos. Eu pago.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:263
translate ptbr carlthursday_bccd7625:

    # "I can't exactly argue with that, so I don't."
    "Não posso exatamente argumentar contra isso, então não o faço."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:264
translate ptbr carlthursday_50af5b78:

    # "I also don't feel like I can leave it at that so, hesitantly, I reach out with a paw and place it on Carl's shoulder."
    "Também não sinto que posso deixar por isso mesmo, então, hesitante, estendo a mão e coloco uma pata no ombro do Carl."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:265
translate ptbr carlthursday_cf9a6069:

    # m "\"Seriously. Let's have fun today, okay? Forget Jenna.\""
    m "\"Sério. Vamos nos divertir hoje, ok? Esquece a Jenna.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:266
translate ptbr carlthursday_20004732:

    # "He looks over at me and gives me a sad smile."
    "Ele olha pra mim e me dá um sorriso triste."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:267
translate ptbr carlthursday_b4672cb5:

    # c "\"I'm fine, Chase. I just wanna get this over with so we can go back and play some games.\""
    c "\"Eu tô bem, Chase. Só quero acabar logo com isso pra a gente poder voltar e jogar videogame.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:268
translate ptbr carlthursday_3f739ce1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Eu suspiro."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:269
translate ptbr carlthursday_643fee0d:

    # m "\"Is that all you think about these days?\""
    m "\"Isso é tudo que você pensa hoje em dia?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:270
translate ptbr carlthursday_3255bd7e:

    # c "\"Hey, lots of people play games for a living.\""
    c "\"Ei, muita gente ganha a vida jogando videogame.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:271
translate ptbr carlthursday_e8d60c81:

    # m "\"Name one.\""
    m "\"Me diga um.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:272
translate ptbr carlthursday_ffb9d1b9:

    # c "\"Rob Lowe.\""
    c "\"Rob Lowe.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:273
translate ptbr carlthursday_87a329d9:

    # m "\"That's a sport.\""
    m "\"Isso é esporte.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:274
translate ptbr carlthursday_0d730e28:

    # c "\"Still a game.\""
    c "\"Ainda é um jogo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:275
translate ptbr carlthursday_d066d96d:

    # "I grin as I hear that jokey playfulness back in his voice, glad I'm able to take his mind off of Jenna for the moment."
    "Eu sorrio ao ouvir aquele tom brincalhão de volta na voz dele, feliz por conseguir tirar a cabeça dele da Jenna por um momento."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:276
translate ptbr carlthursday_7570443f:

    # m "\"Well, at least that keeps them active. Playing games all day will get you...unhealthy.\""
    m "\"Bom, pelo menos isso os mantém ativos. Jogar videogame o dia todo vai te deixar... não saudável.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:277
translate ptbr carlthursday_927b4b29:

    # c "\"Fat? If you didn't notice I'm already there.\""
    c "\"Gordo? Se você não percebeu, eu já cheguei lá.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:278
translate ptbr carlthursday_7c10b401:

    # m "\"You're not that bad. I swear you're mostly muscle.\""
    m "\"Você não tá tão ruim assim. Eu juro que cê é mais músculo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:279
translate ptbr carlthursday_69bed1e0:

    # c "\"Then I guess I've got nothing to worry about.\""
    c "\"Então acho que não tenho com o que me preocupar.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:280
translate ptbr carlthursday_26d1cf2a:

    # m "\"But you should get out more.\""
    m "\"Mas você devia sair mais.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:281
translate ptbr carlthursday_251ec84c:

    # c "\"Why? I've got entire worlds in my game.\""
    c "\"Por quê? Eu tenho mundos inteiros no meu jogo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:282
translate ptbr carlthursday_8d16e462:

    # m "\"I don't know...what about girls?\""
    m "\"Sei lá... e as garotas?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:283
translate ptbr carlthursday_1d657769:

    # c "\"They're in games, too.\""
    c "\"Elas tão nos jogos, também.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:284
translate ptbr carlthursday_5da3edf4:

    # m "\"Well, you can't exactly touch a boob with your actual paws in a game.\""
    m "\"Bom, cê não pode exatamente tocar num peito com suas próprias patas num jogo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:285
translate ptbr carlthursday_240938ac:

    # c "\"I dunno, I swear they've got those in anime land.\""
    c "\"Sei não, eu juro que tem disso na terra dos animes.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:286
translate ptbr carlthursday_93da3405:

    # m "\"You know what I mean.\""
    m "\"Você sabe o que eu quero dizer.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:287
translate ptbr carlthursday_307babf4:

    # c "\"Already done it. Not that great.\""
    c "\"Já fiz isso. Não é lá essas coisas.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:288
translate ptbr carlthursday_c09beaa3:

    # m "\"You a queer, or something?\""
    m "\"Você é viado, ou algo assim?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:289
translate ptbr carlthursday_d27f8139:

    # "I say it with a southern accent."
    "Eu digo isso com um sotaque sulista."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:290
translate ptbr carlthursday_5fe02128:

    # c "\"Let's just say I don't label my sexuality.\""
    c "\"Vamos apenas dizer que eu não rotulo a minha sexualidade.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:291
translate ptbr carlthursday_f46a9d30:

    # "I let that sit for a second."
    "Eu deixo isso no ar por um segundo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:292
translate ptbr carlthursday_d56b34c5:

    # m "\"That's a pretty queer thing to say.\""
    m "\"Essa é uma coisa bem viada de se dizer.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:293
translate ptbr carlthursday_8b59c0da:

    # c "\"Guess I'm a pretty queer dude, then.\""
    c "\"Acho que eu sou um cara bem viado, então.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:294
translate ptbr carlthursday_98c0b7e2:

    # m "\"Is that so?\""
    m "\"Ah é?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:295
translate ptbr carlthursday_d4a1842d:

    # c "\"'Sides, until I'm able to see my hooves again I don't think any girls are gonna be after me.\""
    c "\"Além disso, até eu conseguir ver meus cascos de novo não acho que vai ter alguma garota correndo atrás de mim.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:296
translate ptbr carlthursday_c38ec14e:

    # m "\"Well, that's what we're doing right now; trying to give you a new look, a fresh start.\""
    m "\"Bom, é o que a gente tá fazendo agora; tentando te dar um visual novo, um recomeço.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:297
translate ptbr carlthursday_de02fd29:

    # m "\"It'll boost your confidence AND your appeal. You'll have girls AND boys after you.\""
    m "\"Vai aumentar a sua confiança E o seu apelo. Cê vai ter garotas E garotos atrás de você.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:298
translate ptbr carlthursday_d5d7a0aa:

    # "Again, Carl doesn't act very enthused about that."
    "Mais uma vez, o Carl não age com muito entusiasmo com isso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:299
translate ptbr carlthursday_15088303:

    # "I tell myself it's only because he has to go out. Once we get there I'm sure he'll cheer up..."
    "Digo a mim mesmo que é só porque ele tem que sair. Assim que a gente chegar lá, tenho certeza de que ele vai se animar..."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:303
translate ptbr carlthursday_8f58c6a1:

    # "I swear, every store in the Payton mall is dark and covered in neon."
    "Eu juro, toda loja no shopping de Payton é escura e coberta de neon."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:305
translate ptbr carlthursday_681cdd15:

    # "Carl stands there awkwardly, looking around as if unsure about what to do."
    "O Carl fica ali meio sem jeito, olhando ao redor como se não tivesse certeza do que fazer."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:306
translate ptbr carlthursday_5d586017:

    # m "\"So what kind of look do you wanna go for?\""
    m "\"Então, que tipo de visual você quer?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:307
translate ptbr carlthursday_49c2e55c:

    # "Carl looks at me like I'm crazy."
    "O Carl olha pra mim como se eu fosse louco."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:308
translate ptbr carlthursday_bf9d3466:

    # c "\"Seriously, dude? I have no idea. You brought me here.\""
    c "\"Sério, cara? Eu não faço ideia. Foi você quem me trouxe aqui.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:309
translate ptbr carlthursday_1d97bc1b:

    # m "\"Just work with this for the next hour and I promise we can go to the game store next.\""
    m "\"Só aguenta isso na próxima hora e eu prometo que a gente vai na loja de jogos depois.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:311
translate ptbr carlthursday_c178ee29:

    # "Carl makes a big show of sighing but I assume the twitch in his ears indicates he'd like that a lot."
    "O Carl faz um grande show suspirando, mas eu assumo que o tremor nas orelhas dele indica que ele ia gostar muito disso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:313
translate ptbr carlthursday_b7341cad:

    # c "\"Well, it's just dress clothes, so it shouldn't be that big a deal.\""
    c "\"Bom, é só roupa social, então não deve ser nada demais.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:314
translate ptbr carlthursday_81398685:

    # "Carl's getting all insecure the way he did during the \"surprise\" birthday party."
    "O Carl tá ficando todo inseguro do mesmo jeito que ele ficou durante a festa de aniversário \"surpresa\"."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:315
translate ptbr carlthursday_d55009e4:

    # "It's kinda cute."
    "É meio fofo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:316
translate ptbr carlthursday_afb434da:

    # unk "Carl?...Chase?\""
    unk "\"Carl?... Chase?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:318
translate ptbr carlthursday_011294b6:

    # "The voice comes from behind me and Carl smiles over my shoulder before I turn around."
    "A voz vem de trás de mim e o Carl sorri por cima do meu ombro antes de eu me virar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:319
translate ptbr carlthursday_16448bf1:

    # m "\"Raven!?\""
    m "\"Raven!?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:322
translate ptbr carlthursday_c730bf40:

    # "The black and white two-toned husky is just a few feet behind me, grinning."
    "O husky de dois tons, preto e branco, tá apenas alguns passos atrás de mim, sorrindo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:323
translate ptbr carlthursday_c633820c:

    # ra "\"How long has it been?\""
    ra "\"Quanto tempo faz?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:324
translate ptbr carlthursday_279f4376:

    # c "\"Too long, man. What are you doing here?\""
    c "\"Muito tempo, cara. O que cê tá fazendo aqui?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:325
translate ptbr carlthursday_6a129b74:

    # ra "\"Family moved back after dad got fired...now I work here. I could ask the same about you, Chase.\""
    ra "\"Minha família voltou pra cá depois que meu pai foi demitido... agora eu trabalho aqui. Eu podia perguntar a mesma coisa sobre você, Chase.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:326
translate ptbr carlthursday_2b4519dd:

    # m "\"Oh, uh, just on spring break right now. You work in a clothing store now?\""
    m "\"Ah, uh, só de férias de primavera por enquanto. Cê trabalha numa loja de roupas agora?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:327
translate ptbr carlthursday_21a4104a:

    # "Raven laughs."
    "O Raven ri."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:328
translate ptbr carlthursday_65d3530b:

    # ra "\"No, I'm a store down. I work at Game Central.\""
    ra "\"Não, eu tô uma loja abaixo. Eu trabalho na Game Central.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:329
translate ptbr carlthursday_a81df97c:

    # "Carl perks up at that."
    "O Carl se anima com isso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:330
translate ptbr carlthursday_a7d22a82:

    # ra "\"So you're still in school, huh? Well it's great to see you!\""
    ra "\"Então cê ainda tá na faculdade, hein? Bom, é ótimo ver você!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:331
translate ptbr carlthursday_9b26b7ed:

    # "Raven's accent is only slightly detectable now, the only noticeably foreign thing about him being his name."
    "O sotaque do Raven é só ligeiramente detectável agora, a única coisa notavelmente estrangeira sobre ele sendo o nome."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:332
translate ptbr carlthursday_ba209d83:

    # ra "\"So what are you guys doing here? Getting clothes?\""
    ra "\"Então, o que vocês tão fazendo aqui? Comprando roupas?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:333
translate ptbr carlthursday_aee3baeb:

    # m "\"Yeah! For Carl, actually. He has an interview tomorrow.\""
    m "\"Sim! Pro Carl, na verdade. Ele tem uma entrevista amanhã.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:335
translate ptbr carlthursday_9c1c0ad4:

    # "For some reason Carl ducks his head at that and, through his ears, I can see him blush deeply."
    "Por algum motivo o Carl abaixa a cabeça com isso e, pelas orelhas, eu vejo que ele corou muito."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:336
translate ptbr carlthursday_92824abc:

    # ra "\"Oh really? It's about time!\""
    ra "\"Ah, é? Já tava na hora!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:337
translate ptbr carlthursday_f8419476:

    # c "\"I mean, I HAVE had a job before...\""
    c "\"Digo, eu JÁ tive um emprego antes...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:338
translate ptbr carlthursday_e479313d:

    # ra "\"So what kind of look are you going for?\""
    ra "\"Então, qual tipo de visual cê quer?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:339
translate ptbr carlthursday_3acc36c1:

    # "When Carl doesn't answer I speak up."
    "Quando o Carl não responde, eu falo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:340
translate ptbr carlthursday_f43ec9a2:

    # m "\"That's what we were trying to figure out just now, actually.\""
    m "\"Isso é o que a gente tava tentando descobrir agora mesmo, na verdade.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:342
translate ptbr carlthursday_920ac036:

    # ra "\"Hmm...\""
    ra "\"Hmm...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:344
translate ptbr carlthursday_e9c47b5f:

    # "Carl shrinks further into himself, his hat seeming to fall further over his eyes."
    "O Carl se encolhe ainda mais, o boné parecendo cair ainda mais sobre os olhos dele."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:345
translate ptbr carlthursday_d00f3d0a:

    # c "\"Dude, It's just dress clothes, really...\""
    c "\"Cara, é só roupa social, sério...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:346
translate ptbr carlthursday_0a0fb2d8:

    # ra "\"Well, I think you should get a red tie, at least, might go good with your eyes. And maybe trim that beard?\""
    ra "\"Bom, eu acho que cê devia pegar uma gravata vermelha, pelo menos, ia combinar com seus olhos. E talvez dar uma aparada nessa barba?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:348
translate ptbr carlthursday_10aace9a:

    # c "\"Since when are you a fashionista?\""
    c "\"Desde quando cê é fashionista?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:349
translate ptbr carlthursday_f0b285ca:

    # m "\"Come on Carl, let's at least try it out.\""
    m "\"Qual é Carl, vamos pelo menos tentar.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:350
translate ptbr carlthursday_e9abf835:

    # "Carl sighs, rubbing his forehead."
    "O Carl suspira, esfregando a testa."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:351
translate ptbr carlthursday_c0b9c378:

    # c "\"Okay, fine, but only as long as we're outta here in the next hour...\""
    c "\"Tá bom, tudo bem, mas só se a gente sair daqui na próxima hora...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:353
translate ptbr carlthursday_b8e7d1b8:

    # ra "\"Hey, I gotta get back to work, but I'll be free in about an hour. Let's catch up!\""
    ra "\"Ei, eu tenho que voltar pro trabalho, mas estarei livre em mais ou menos uma hora. Vamos botar o papo em dia!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:355
translate ptbr carlthursday_80cf601d:

    # "I wave at Raven, then turn to Carl."
    "Eu aceno pro Raven, depois me viro pro Carl."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:356
translate ptbr carlthursday_7e04ac71:

    # m "\"Well that was nice. Didn't think I'd ever see him again.\""
    m "\"Bom, isso foi legal. Não achei que ia ver ele de novo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:358
translate ptbr carlthursday_31e7b0ae:

    # c "\"Me neither, actually. I'll have to hang out with him more.\""
    c "\"Nem eu, na verdade. Vou ter que sair mais com ele.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:359
translate ptbr carlthursday_48bff527:

    # c "\"I mean, I like Flynn, but having to put up with him just to get a ride to the store isn't always worth it.\""
    c "\"Sabe, eu gosto do Flynn, mas ter que aguentar ele só pra pegar uma carona até a loja nem sempre vale a pena.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:360
translate ptbr carlthursday_e0bc3975:

    # m "\"Well anyway, if you're wanting to get out of here in an hour then we should probably get started.\""
    m "\"Bom, de qualquer forma, se cê quer sair daqui em uma hora então a gente provavelmente devia começar.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:362
translate ptbr carlthursday_67396bc8:

    # "The process is a lot less painful than Carl makes it out to be."
    "O processo é bem menos doloroso do que o Carl faz parecer."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:363
translate ptbr carlthursday_3bda4e80:

    # "Soon enough, we're on our way to the food court, Carl carrying a bag way too big for the contents inside."
    "Logo em seguida, tamos a caminho da praça de alimentação, o Carl carregando uma sacola grande demais pro conteúdo dentro dela."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:364
translate ptbr carlthursday_ea0b5b86:

    # "We meet Raven again and, once we get our food, he suggests we eat outside."
    "Encontramos o Raven de novo e, assim que pegamos nossa comida, ele sugere comermos lá fora."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:366
translate ptbr carlthursday_f46af057:

    # "I look from my full combo meal to Carl's small, tiny container of tater tots."
    "Eu olho da minha refeição combinada completa pro potinho minúsculo de tater tots do Carl."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:367
translate ptbr carlthursday_1fb1f823:

    # m "\"You not hungry?\""
    m "\"Cê não tá com fome?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:368
translate ptbr carlthursday_b2883f86:

    # "Carl just shrugs and grins at me."
    "O Carl só dá de ombros e sorri pra mim."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:370
translate ptbr carlthursday_82b1aebd:

    # c "\"You just don't know the ways of the fatty.\""
    c "\"Você que não conhece os caminhos dos gordinhos.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:371
translate ptbr carlthursday_ac94747a:

    # m "\"Huh?\""
    m "\"Hã?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:372
translate ptbr carlthursday_ba531ecf:

    # c "\"We're judged all the time, especially when we're eating.\""
    c "\"A gente é julgado o tempo todo, especialmente quando tamo comendo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:373
translate ptbr carlthursday_1d5c2825:

    # "He delicately bites a tater tot in half before adopting a sarcastic tone."
    "Ele morde delicadamente um tater tot ao meio antes de adotar um tom sarcástico."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:374
translate ptbr carlthursday_ab1bc179:

    # c "\"'Ew gross, of course he's eating.'\""
    c "\"Eca que nojo, claro que ele tá comendo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:375
translate ptbr carlthursday_62fa665f:

    # m "\"That seems kind of unfair.\""
    m "\"Isso parece meio injusto.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:376
translate ptbr carlthursday_b4832912:

    # c "\"See, Raven thinks so, too.\""
    c "\"Viu, o Raven também acha.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:377
translate ptbr carlthursday_92ce2141:

    # "The husky is in the middle of a huge bite of his subway sandwich, his eyes on Carl. He swallows before speaking."
    "O husky tá no meio de uma mordida gigante do sanduíche de subway dele, os olhos no Carl. Ele engole antes de falar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:379
translate ptbr carlthursday_b9a5b179:

    # ra "\"I can see that you're self-deprecating as ever.\""
    ra "\"Posso ver que cê tá tão autodepreciativo como sempre.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:380
translate ptbr carlthursday_0d9cdb7b:

    # c "\"You know me.\""
    c "\"Cê me conhece.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:382
translate ptbr carlthursday_9a6d19ac:

    # ra "\"So Chase, are you still dating that wolf...uh, Leon?\""
    ra "\"Então Chase, cê ainda tá namorando aquele lobo... uh, Leon?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:384
translate ptbr carlthursday_042fa2d7:

    # m "\"Leo, and no.\""
    m "\"Leo, e não.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:385
translate ptbr carlthursday_6eb568ce:

    # "I ignore the sidelong glance I get from Carl."
    "Eu ignoro o olhar de soslaio que recebo do Carl."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:386
translate ptbr carlthursday_c2556765:

    # ra "\"Ah, sorry about that. You two were really cute together.\""
    ra "\"Ah, foi mal por isso. Vocês dois eram bem fofos juntos.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:387
translate ptbr carlthursday_45482042:

    # "It's hard to know what to say when people comment on your relationship."
    "É difícil saber o que dizer quando as pessoas comentam sobre seu relacionamento."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:388
translate ptbr carlthursday_6e9146cc:

    # "If someone isn't homophobic, gay relationships are usually \"cute\" or \"adorable\"."
    "Se alguém não é homofóbico, relacionamentos gays geralmente são \"fofos\" ou \"adoráveis\"."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:389
translate ptbr carlthursday_9d8baf6e:

    # "OR maybe it was just the size difference."
    "OU talvez fosse só a diferença de tamanho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:390
translate ptbr carlthursday_ca18c681:

    # ra "\"But seriously, I've always wanted to date an otter.\""
    ra "\"Mas falando sério, eu sempre quis namorar uma lontra.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:391
translate ptbr carlthursday_6c6c25c1:

    # m "\"Oh really?\""
    m "\"Ah, sério?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:392
translate ptbr carlthursday_4a8ff558:

    # ra "\"Yeah, they're adorable.\""
    ra "\"Sim, elas são adoráveis.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:393
translate ptbr carlthursday_199d63c6:

    # "{i}Swimming clowns.{/i}"
    "{i}Palhaços nadadores.{/i}"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:394
translate ptbr carlthursday_cb692432:

    # m "\"Do tell.\""
    m "\"Me conte mais.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:396
translate ptbr carlthursday_d67bcce8:

    # "Raven picks up on my sarcastic tone right away, but it doesn't seem to phase him."
    "O Raven percebe meu tom sarcástico na hora, mas isso não parece abalá-lo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:397
translate ptbr carlthursday_f0f3c2be:

    # ra "\"Well, yeah. You know what they say about otters and blow jobs.\""
    ra "\"Bem, sim. Cê sabe o que dizem sobre lontras e boquetes.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:399
translate ptbr carlthursday_c46327d9:

    # "Carl almost chokes on his last tater tot."
    "O Carl quase engasga com o último tater tot dele."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:401
translate ptbr carlthursday_23d62331:

    # c "\"The hell, Raven? You barely know him and you're saying that shit!\""
    c "\"Que porra, Raven? Cê mal conhece ele e tá falando essa merda!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:402
translate ptbr carlthursday_47ea1430:

    # "Carl's laughing, though."
    "Mas o Carl tá rindo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:403
translate ptbr carlthursday_7568ee83:

    # "I'm sure to keep my face passive."
    "Eu me certifico de manter minha expressão passiva."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:404
translate ptbr carlthursday_c5a7d659:

    # m "\"Oh? What do they say about otters and blow jobs?\""
    m "\"Ah? O que eles dizem sobre lontras e boquetes?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:405
translate ptbr carlthursday_21a4104a_1:

    # "Raven laughs."
    "O Raven ri."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:406
translate ptbr carlthursday_e80ae01f:

    # ra "\"You know. They never have to come up for air. Ten minutes, non stop!\""
    ra "\"Cê sabe. Eles nunca precisam subir pra respirar. Dez minutos, sem parar!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:407
translate ptbr carlthursday_fb96e19f:

    # "Raven giggles, then makes a visible effort to keep a straight face."
    "O Raven dá uma risadinha, e depois faz um esforço visível pra manter a cara séria."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:409
translate ptbr carlthursday_23b1d708:

    # ra "\"Sorry, I don't mean to make you uncomfortable. It's just one of those jokes I always hear.\""
    ra "\"Foi mal, eu não queria te deixar desconfortável. É só uma dessas piadas que eu sempre ouço.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:410
translate ptbr carlthursday_351e5df1:

    # m "\"You can imagine I do, too, and it's eight minutes, by the way.\""
    m "\"Cê pode imaginar que eu também, e são oito minutos, por sinal.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:412
translate ptbr carlthursday_fe76eff6:

    # ra "\"Psh, I'd take that, too.\""
    ra "\"Psh, eu aceitaria isso também.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:413
translate ptbr carlthursday_3e436cb7:

    # "Carl crumples up a straw wrapper and flicks it off Raven's blue-ish looking nose, to which he simply smiles."
    "O Carl amassa a embalagem de um canudo e dá um peteleco no nariz azulado do Raven, que ele simplesmente responde com um sorriso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:414
translate ptbr carlthursday_cf51dbdb:

    # "Carl stands up."
    "O Carl se levanta."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:415
translate ptbr carlthursday_cbb6515b:

    # c "\"Hey, I'm going to the bathroom. Raven, don't be a dick.\""
    c "\"Ei, vou no banheiro. Raven, não seja cuzão.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:416
translate ptbr carlthursday_75858e5d:

    # ra "\"I'm not!\""
    ra "\"Não tô sendo!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:418
translate ptbr carlthursday_bd7e9d04:

    # "We both watch Carl amble off before Raven turns back to me, that dopey smile back on his face."
    "Nós dois observamos o Carl se afastar antes do Raven se voltar pra mim, com aquele sorriso bobo de volta ao rosto."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:420
translate ptbr carlthursday_fe4c4475:

    # ra "\"So how long are you gonna be here, Chase? We need to catch up!\""
    ra "\"Então, quanto tempo cê vai ficar aqui, Chase? Precisamos botar o papo em dia!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:421
translate ptbr carlthursday_ce58bf18:

    # "I wonder what catching up means when our biggest interaction up until this point was dissecting a shark in high school biology."
    "Eu me pergunto o que botar o papo em dia significa, já que nossa maior interação até esse momento foi dissecar um tubarão na aula de biologia do ensino médio."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:422
translate ptbr carlthursday_f04c46be:

    # m "\"Sunday. School starts up again on Monday.\""
    m "\"Domingo. A faculdade começa de novo na segunda.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:423
translate ptbr carlthursday_e13620d9:

    # "Despite having a head start on the project thanks to Carl's mom, I still get a nervous twinge in my stomach."
    "Apesar de ter um bom avanço no projeto graças à mãe do Carl, ainda sinto um frio na barriga de nervosismo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:424
translate ptbr carlthursday_bf9ef6c7:

    # "I still have a lot left to do."
    "Eu ainda tenho muito o que fazer."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:425
translate ptbr carlthursday_97cbc1e2:

    # "Voice overs, b-rolls, and oh God, editing."
    "Locuções, imagens de apoio e, ai meu Deus, edição."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:426
translate ptbr carlthursday_7619e409:

    # ra "\"We should hang out!\""
    ra "\"A gente devia sair!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:427
translate ptbr carlthursday_259302fa:

    # "His adorable excitement is barely contained and I'm pretty sure I can hear the thumping of his tail against the curb we're sitting on."
    "A animação adorável dele mal é contida e eu tenho quase certeza que consigo ouvir o baque do rabo dele contra a calçada em que tamos sentados."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:428
translate ptbr carlthursday_08f3a706:

    # "Despite my earlier offense at his stereotyping of otters, I'm reminded at how much worse dogs get it."
    "Apesar de ter me sentido ofendido mais cedo com os estereótipos dele sobre lontras, me lembro de como é muito pior com cachorros."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:429
translate ptbr carlthursday_84a2c8d7:

    # "They're not common in Echo, or this side of the world, for that matter."
    "Eles não são comuns em Echo, ou desse lado do mundo, aliás."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:430
translate ptbr carlthursday_17d1ba3d:

    # "While otters are thought of as entertainers, I feel like it's better than dealing with being seen as a simpleton."
    "Enquanto as lontras são vistas como animadores, eu sinto que é melhor do que lidar com a ideia de ser visto como um simplório."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:431
translate ptbr carlthursday_e2d38348:

    # m "\"So the main reason I'm here is to do a news segment on Echo, for class.\""
    m "\"Então, o motivo principal de eu estar aqui é pra fazer um segmento de notícias sobre Echo, pra faculdade.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:432
translate ptbr carlthursday_42760d07:

    # ra "\"Ooh! Is it gonna be on TV?\""
    ra "\"Ooh! Vai passar na TV?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:433
translate ptbr carlthursday_e33f02ef:

    # "I laugh."
    "Eu dou risada."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:434
translate ptbr carlthursday_0eda5fee:

    # m "\"No, I mean, maybe I could get it into rotation on the college TV station, but otherwise no.\""
    m "\"Não, eu quis dizer, talvez eu possa colocar ele na rotação do canal de TV da faculdade, mas fora isso, não.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:435
translate ptbr carlthursday_b29aebce:

    # ra "\"Well that's still pretty cool!\""
    ra "\"Bom, isso ainda é bem legal!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:436
translate ptbr carlthursday_79836435:

    # m "\"But my point is that it's kinda boring...\""
    m "\"Mas meu ponto é que é meio chato...\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:437
translate ptbr carlthursday_51d265f6:

    # ra "\"What? Is it just a bunch of writing, or...?\""
    ra "\"O quê? É só um monte de coisa escrita, ou...?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:438
translate ptbr carlthursday_b0b10e0c:

    # m "\"Mostly going through old stuff. Carl's family saved a bunch of artifacts from the old days.\""
    m "\"Na maior parte, é só revirar coisas antigas. A família do Carl guardou um monte de artefatos dos velhos tempos.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:439
translate ptbr carlthursday_265f6d11:

    # ra "\"Whoa, so you're like, actually touching the old stuff?\""
    ra "\"Uau, então cê tá tipo, encostando de verdade nas coisas antigas?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:440
translate ptbr carlthursday_14dd5f42:

    # m "\"Uh, yeah. That's kind of a weird way to put it, but yeah.\""
    m "\"Uh, sim. É um jeito meio estranho de falar, mas sim.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:441
translate ptbr carlthursday_c5e81443:

    # ra "\"That sounds awesome!\""
    ra "\"Isso parece incrível!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:442
translate ptbr carlthursday_599bd7cc:

    # "His outgoing nature is kind of infectious. I smile."
    "A natureza extrovertida dele é meio contagiante. Eu sorrio."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:443
translate ptbr carlthursday_e20a1baf:

    # m "\"Well, if you're really interested I wouldn't mind having some help.\""
    m "\"Bom, se cê tá mesmo interessado eu não me importaria de ter um pouco de ajuda.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:444
translate ptbr carlthursday_d0e30e0c:

    # ra "\"That's great! I have the next two days off.\""
    ra "\"Isso é ótimo! Eu tenho os próximos dois dias de folga.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:445
translate ptbr carlthursday_72a4f0e5:

    # m "\"Cool! We'll ask Carl when he gets back.\""
    m "\"Legal! Vamos perguntar pro Carl quando ele voltar.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:447
translate ptbr carlthursday_47a7eed6:

    # "It takes a while for the ram to return, but when he does he seems a bit reluctant to agree to the idea, which kind of surprises me."
    "Leva um tempo pro carneiro voltar, mas quando ele volta ele parece um pouco relutante em concordar com a ideia, o que me surpreende um pouco."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:448
translate ptbr carlthursday_adfdcd9a:

    # "But eventually we convince him and we make plans for Raven to come over the next day."
    "Mas a gente acaba convencendo ele e planejamos pro Raven vir no dia seguinte."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:451
translate ptbr carlthursday_50e70900:

    # "As we're heading back out to the car I nudge Carl, forcing him into a slight stumble."
    "Enquanto tamos voltando pro carro, dou um empurrãozinho no Carl, forçando ele a tropeçar de leve."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:453
translate ptbr carlthursday_f4afd675:

    # c "\"Hm?\""
    c "\"Hm?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:454
translate ptbr carlthursday_b78c5883:

    # m "\"What's up?\""
    m "\"Que foi?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:455
translate ptbr carlthursday_1503bb3d:

    # c "\"What do you mean?\""
    c "\"Como assim?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:456
translate ptbr carlthursday_2ff49c6a:

    # "I try to keep my tone light."
    "Eu tento manter meu tom leve."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:457
translate ptbr carlthursday_0c115c27:

    # m "\"You seem a bit down. Actually, you have all day.\""
    m "\"Cê parece um pouco pra baixo. Na verdade, cê tá assim o dia todo.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:458
translate ptbr carlthursday_d31e01d3:

    # "Carl shrugs."
    "O Carl dá de ombros."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:459
translate ptbr carlthursday_4bad7f5f:

    # "I nudge him again and he giggles."
    "Eu dou outro empurrãozinho e ele dá uma risadinha."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:461
translate ptbr carlthursday_5fd10e33:

    # c "\"I dunno. It's just awkward coming out here and having you two just examine me like that.\""
    c "\"Sei não. É só meio estranho vir aqui e ter vocês dois me examinando daquele jeito.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:462
translate ptbr carlthursday_4c637e12:

    # m "\"Oh...yeah?\""
    m "\"Ah... é?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:463
translate ptbr carlthursday_c3e0fbf7:

    # c "\"Yeah dude. It just feels kinda weird, is all.\""
    c "\"É, cara. Só parece meio esquisito, só isso.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:464
translate ptbr carlthursday_3fc29e35:

    # "I stay silent for a moment, wondering if I'd made the right decision in doing all this."
    "Eu fico em silêncio por um momento, me perguntando se eu tinha tomado a decisão certa em fazer tudo isso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:465
translate ptbr carlthursday_224a0a38:

    # m "\"Well, I'm just trying to help you out, you know?\""
    m "\"Bom, eu só tô tentando te ajudar, sabe?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:466
translate ptbr carlthursday_712f1ca8:

    # c "\"I know, bro. It's cool.\""
    c "\"Eu sei, mano. Tá de boa.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:467
translate ptbr carlthursday_ad0bbc38:

    # m "\"Seriously. I've been thinking..\""
    m "\"Sério. Eu tava pensando..\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:468
translate ptbr carlthursday_9857257e:

    # c "\"Oh no."
    c "\"Ah não.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:469
translate ptbr carlthursday_a3cf7960:

    # m "\"Your main problem is worrying about going out in public, like a social anxiety.\""
    m "\"Seu problema principal é se preocupar em sair em público, tipo uma ansiedade social.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:470
translate ptbr carlthursday_93c09645:

    # c "\"Whoa, now you're sounding like Jenna.\""
    c "\"Eita, agora cê tá parecendo a Jenna.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:471
translate ptbr carlthursday_6832b24b:

    # "We get to my car and he smiles at me over the roof while I unlock the doors."
    "Chegamos no meu carro e ele sorri pra mim por cima do teto enquanto eu destranco as portas."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:472
translate ptbr carlthursday_e0ec95a0:

    # m "\"I feel like if we can break through that, it'll help you out a bunch.\""
    m "\"Eu sinto que se conseguirmos passar por isso, vai te ajudar pra caramba.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:473
translate ptbr carlthursday_a3e1cc82:

    # "I break eye contact as we both slide into our respective seats."
    "Eu quebro o contato visual enquanto nós dois deslizamos para nossos respectivos assentos."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:475
translate ptbr carlthursday_a9baab8b:

    # m "\"And I think this job will be a huge part of that, so I really want you to get it.\""
    m "\"E eu acho que esse trabalho vai ser uma grande parte disso, então eu realmente quero que cê consiga.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:476
translate ptbr carlthursday_126d3e01:

    # "As I lean to the side to pull out my seatbelt, I feel something soft and warm press to my cheek."
    "Ao me inclinar pro lado pra puxar meu cinto de segurança, sinto algo macio e quente encostar na minha bochecha."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:477
translate ptbr carlthursday_1242fd7a:

    # "It only lasts for a second, then it's gone."
    "Dura apenas um segundo, depois desaparece."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:478
translate ptbr carlthursday_d394e58c:

    # "I look over at Carl, but he's looking out the window."
    "Eu olho pro Carl, mas ele tá olhando pela janela."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:479
translate ptbr carlthursday_d7edacf9:

    # m "\"Did you just kiss me?\""
    m "\"Cê acabou de me beijar?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:480
translate ptbr carlthursday_eae2c901:

    # c "\"Yeah bro.\""
    c "\"Sim mano.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:481
translate ptbr carlthursday_3af574e3:

    # m "\"Are you high?\""
    m "\"Cê tá chapado?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:482
translate ptbr carlthursday_3a9c37c6:

    # c "\"No, I mean...maybe?\""
    c "\"Não, quer dizer... talvez?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:483
translate ptbr carlthursday_f5608e95:

    # "He giggles."
    "Ele dá uma risadinha."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:484
translate ptbr carlthursday_0cd5c6c8:

    # m "\"So yes.\""
    m "\"Então, sim.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:485
translate ptbr carlthursday_9a959dec:

    # "Slowly, I pull out of the parking space."
    "Lentamente, eu saio da vaga de estacionamento."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:487
translate ptbr carlthursday_d7b2cd08:

    # "If he hadn't made a move on me last night I might have been a little more shocked."
    "Se ele não tivesse dado em cima de mim ontem à noite, eu talvez tivesse ficado um pouco mais chocado."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:488
translate ptbr carlthursday_fbb0cdd0:

    # m "\"Where the hell did you get high anyway?\""
    m "\"Onde diabos cê fumou, de qualquer jeito?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:489
translate ptbr carlthursday_9239cf6e:

    # c "\"Alley behind the mall.\""
    c "\"No beco atrás do shopping.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:490
translate ptbr carlthursday_f9a81c46:

    # m "\"Charming.\""
    m "\"Encantador.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:491
translate ptbr carlthursday_d76db7c6:

    # c "\"Yeah, pretty sure I've got a few needles stuck in my hooves.\""
    c "\"É, tenho quase certeza que tem umas seringas espetadas nos meus cascos.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:492
translate ptbr carlthursday_2f787c9e:

    # "We drive in silence for a while, Carl looking out at the desert scenery while I squint out the windshield, trying to see through the hazy orange sunset."
    "Dirigimos em silêncio por um tempo, o Carl olhando pra paisagem do deserto enquanto eu aperto os olhos pelo para-brisa, tentando enxergar através do pôr do sol laranja nebuloso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:493
translate ptbr carlthursday_c4aa6538:

    # c "\"I did mean that, by the way.\""
    c "\"Eu falei sério, por sinal.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:494
translate ptbr carlthursday_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"O quê?\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:495
translate ptbr carlthursday_a7280804:

    # c "\"Just...thanks.\""
    c "\"Só... obrigado.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:496
translate ptbr carlthursday_910f899d:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Por nada.\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:497
translate ptbr carlthursday_1aeff074:

    # "I don't know what else to say, so I leave it at that and we drive along in pleasant silence."
    "Eu não sei mais o que dizer, então deixo por isso mesmo e dirigimos num silêncio agradável."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:498
translate ptbr carlthursday_43d3c1c4:

    # "Carl still seems a little sad, and I can't pinpoint why."
    "O Carl ainda parece um pouco triste, e eu não consigo apontar o porquê."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:499
translate ptbr carlthursday_c2f10320:

    # "I'm hoping that it's just a phase—"
    "Eu espero que seja só uma fase—"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:500
translate ptbr carlthursday_722bb479:

    # "—that by the time this interview is over he'll be able to get past his anxiety and finally be done feeling like a failure at everything."
    "—que no momento em que essa entrevista acabar, ele consiga superar a ansiedade dele e finalmente pare de se sentir um fracasso em tudo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:510
translate ptbr carlthursday_0f6b8541:

    # "I wake up to the feeling of a familiar, numbing heaviness in my body."
    "Eu acordo com a sensação de um peso familiar e entorpecente no meu corpo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:511
translate ptbr carlthursday_26f4e577:

    # "I try to move, tugging at what feels like a massive weight on my arms and legs, but all I can manage is to wiggle my fingers."
    "Eu tento me mover, puxando o que parece ser um peso enorme nos meus braços e pernas, mas tudo que consigo é mexer os dedos."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:512
translate ptbr carlthursday_5a25d844:

    # "It feels like someone's pressing down on my chest, trying to suffocate me."
    "Parece que tem alguém pressionando meu peito, tentando me sufocar."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:513
translate ptbr carlthursday_0ca161a0:

    # "And something's in the room with me."
    "E tem alguma coisa no quarto comigo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:514
translate ptbr carlthursday_e2af9de6:

    # "I can't help myself; I open my eyes."
    "Eu não consigo me segurar; eu abro os olhos."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:516
translate ptbr carlthursday_e977aa47:

    # "A blood red glow fills Carl's room, as if from a night light covered in blood."
    "Um brilho vermelho sangue preenche o quarto do Carl, como se fosse de uma luz noturna coberta de sangue."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:517
translate ptbr carlthursday_59625a40:

    # "The sight would have made me whimper if I was able to make any kind of sound."
    "A visão teria me feito choramingar se eu fosse capaz de fazer qualquer tipo de som."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:518
translate ptbr carlthursday_11bfe69d:

    # "My eyes flick around the room."
    "Meus olhos piscam pelo quarto."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:519
translate ptbr carlthursday_3410c875:

    # "It looks strangely empty, a lot more empty than I remember it, as if Carl is in the middle of a move and he'd packed up all of his toys and decorations."
    "Parece estranhamente vazio, muito mais vazio do que eu me lembro, como se o Carl estivesse no meio de uma mudança e tivesse empacotado todos os brinquedos e decorações dele."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:520
translate ptbr carlthursday_6356ebc5:

    # "In fact, the only thing I recognize in his room is his bed, the blankets tossed back and empty."
    "Na verdade, a única coisa que eu reconheço no quarto dele é a cama, os cobertores jogados pra trás e vazia."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:521
translate ptbr carlthursday_0dd0f46c:

    # "I'm alone."
    "Eu tô sozinho."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:523
translate ptbr carlthursday_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:524
translate ptbr carlthursday_773f706c:

    # "I hear a chuckle, right next to my ear, and it's straight out of a horror movie."
    "Eu ouço uma risadinha, bem perto do meu ouvido, e é direto de um filme de terror."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:525
translate ptbr carlthursday_930b61ad:

    # "Whatever it is, it's right out of my line of sight and I can't turn my head to see what it is."
    "Seja lá o que for, tá bem fora da minha linha de visão e eu não consigo virar a cabeça pra ver o que é."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:526
translate ptbr carlthursday_df234784:

    # "My heartbeat picks up and I decide to close my eyes, knowing that nothing good will come out of opening them."
    "Meus batimentos aceleram e eu decido fechar os olhos, sabendo que nada de bom vai sair de abri-los."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:528
translate ptbr carlthursday_ae4e21e5:

    # "It breathes heavily in my ear for a while, then stops."
    "Isso respira pesadamente no meu ouvido por um tempo, depois para."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:530
translate ptbr carlthursday_a270b3a3:

    # "The weight lifts off of my body and I feel its presence leave."
    "O peso sai do meu corpo e eu sinto a presença ir embora."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:532
translate ptbr carlthursday_22e576a0:

    # "I sit up, open my eyes again, and sigh with relief."
    "Eu me sento, abro os olhos de novo e suspiro de alívio."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:533
translate ptbr carlthursday_6ddbafa9:

    # "But then I realize the room is still empty, and so is Carl's bed."
    "Mas então eu percebo que o quarto continua vazio, assim como a cama do Carl."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:535
translate ptbr carlthursday_a61628c5:

    # "???" "\"DIE!\""
    "???" "\"MORRA!\""

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:536
translate ptbr carlthursday_56ad44d6:

    # "Something yanks me out of bed and suddenly I'm being pulled by both feet down the hallway—"
    "Alguma coisa me arranca da cama e de repente eu tô sendo puxado pelos dois pés pelo corredor—"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:538
translate ptbr carlthursday_6895c102:

    # "Down the stairs—"
    "Descendo as escadas—"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:540
translate ptbr carlthursday_5d047538:

    # "Down the basement—"
    "Descendo pro porão—"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:542
translate ptbr carlthursday_49ba0ebb:

    # "Towards the crawl space—"
    "Em direção ao espaço apertado—"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:543
translate ptbr carlthursday_fbf83181:

    # "Into darkness—"
    "Para a escuridão—"

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:544
translate ptbr carlthursday_9ea4a5b0:

    # "Furry legs crawl all over my body and pin pricks pierce ever inch of my flesh."
    "Pernas peludas rastejam por todo o meu corpo e picadas furam cada centímetro da minha carne."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:545
translate ptbr carlthursday_12a86254:

    # "I'd give anything to be able to scream right now."
    "Eu daria tudo pra conseguir gritar agora mesmo."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:548
translate ptbr carlthursday_2b0c7d44:

    # "I gasp and jolt out of the paralysis."
    "Eu ofego e saio da paralisia com um solavanco."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:549
translate ptbr carlthursday_bd96f618:

    # "I wait a good ten seconds before I'm convinced that I'm really out of it."
    "Eu espero uns bons dez segundos antes de me convencer de que eu realmente saí disso."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:550
translate ptbr carlthursday_504ae064:

    # "Carl's snoring loudly in his bed, one arm dangling over the side while his belly rises and falls."
    "O Carl tá roncando alto na cama dele, um braço pendurado na beira enquanto a barriga dele sobe e desce."

# game/Carl-Thursday.rpy:551
translate ptbr carlthursday_d4c3c4a7:

    # "I sit up and rub my face, wondering how the hell I'm gonna get back to sleep after that."
    "Eu me sento e esfrego o rosto, me perguntando como diabos eu vou voltar a dormir depois dessa."

